{"id": "ru-da99333f94d3.en", "jokeId": "ru-da99333f94d3", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line. The driver is a young man in a dark suit and bow tie so the groom reveal pays off; the stop happens on the road, the cell scene in the police station after a flyover.", "title": "The Groom", "location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "paren"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "police-officer", "paren": "everyman"}, "scenes": [{"location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "paren"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "police-officer", "paren": "everyman"}, "looks": {"paren": {"add": ["bow-tie"], "clothes": "#1f1f24"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "roadside"}, {"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "car"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}]}, {"location": "ofis", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "paren"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "police-officer", "paren": "everyman"}, "looks": {"paren": {"add": ["bow-tie"], "clothes": "#1f1f24"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A cop pulls over a driver who was going way over the speed limit.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "But sir, I can explain everything!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "You'll explain everything to my chief, and meanwhile you'll sit in a cell!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "But I want to say...", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Shut up...", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "A few hours later the cop walks into the driver's cell and says:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "You're lucky, the chief is at his daughter's wedding right now, so when he gets here he'll be in a good mood!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Don't count on it. I'm the groom.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-da99333f94d3.de", "jokeId": "ru-da99333f94d3", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; 'sir' becomes 'Herr Polizist'. The driver is a young man in a dark suit and bow tie so the groom reveal pays off; road stop, then the cell in the police station.", "title": "Der Bräutigam", "location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "paren"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "police-officer", "paren": "everyman"}, "scenes": [{"location": "doroga", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "paren"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "police-officer", "paren": "everyman"}, "looks": {"paren": {"add": ["bow-tie"], "clothes": "#1f1f24"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "roadside"}, {"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "car"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}]}, {"location": "ofis", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["sluzhivy", "paren"], "roles": {"sluzhivy": "police-officer", "paren": "everyman"}, "looks": {"paren": {"add": ["bow-tie"], "clothes": "#1f1f24"}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "from": "off-left", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein Polizist hält einen Raser an, der viel zu schnell gefahren ist.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Aber, Herr Polizist, ich kann alles erklären!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Das erklärst du alles meinem Chef, und bis dahin sitzt du in der Zelle!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Aber ich will doch sagen...", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Halt den Mund...", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein paar Stunden später kommt der Polizist in die Zelle und sagt:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Du hast Glück, der Chef ist gerade auf der Hochzeit seiner Tochter. Wenn er kommt, hat er bestimmt gute Laune!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Darauf würde ich nicht zählen. Ich bin der Bräutigam.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-7c99c57be493.ru", "jokeId": "ru-7c99c57be493", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Narration kept as written, split at the quoted lines; the wife voices 'Отгадай кто?' as she walks up behind him, the man answers. The closing advice stays with the narrator because it is the source's own last line.", "title": "Отгадай кто", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Очень полезный совет мужчинам.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Если ваши глаза закрыли мягкие ручки, в спину упёрлась пышная грудь и пухленький животик, а сзади послышалось:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Отгадай кто?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "enter": ["zhena"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "В любом случае отвечайте:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Серёга, ты что ли?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Поверьте, так будет лучше.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-7c99c57be493.en", "jokeId": "ru-7c99c57be493", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; Seryoga renamed to Dave per adaptNote. The wife voices 'Guess who?', the closing advice stays with the narrator as in the source.", "title": "Guess Who", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A very useful piece of advice for men.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "If soft little hands cover your eyes, a full bosom and a chubby little tummy press into your back, and from behind you hear:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Guess who?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "enter": ["zhena"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Whatever happens, answer:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Dave, is that you?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Trust me, it's better that way.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-7c99c57be493.de", "jokeId": "ru-7c99c57be493", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; Seryoga renamed to Jürgen per adaptNote. The wife voices 'Rate mal, wer?', the closing advice stays with the narrator as in the source.", "title": "Rate mal, wer", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein sehr nützlicher Rat für Männer.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Wenn weiche Händchen Ihnen die Augen zuhalten, sich ein üppiger Busen und ein rundes Bäuchlein an Ihren Rücken drücken und Sie von hinten hören:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Rate mal, wer?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "enter": ["zhena"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Antworten Sie auf jeden Fall:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Jürgen, bist du das?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Glauben Sie mir, so ist es besser.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-8e7f515e4ba5.ru", "jokeId": "ru-8e7f515e4ba5", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Dialogue kept word for word. The neighbour is an elderly woman (cast fixed from muzhik-sosed to tyoshcha in a headscarf); Vovochka walks in on his way from school. Only the swear word is softened.", "title": "Нормально", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["tyoshcha", "vovochka"], "roles": {"tyoshcha": "old-woman", "vovochka": "vovochka"}, "looks": {"tyoshcha": {"add": ["headscarf"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "Как дела, Вовочка?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["vovochka"]}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Нормально.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "А в школе как?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Нормально.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "А здоровье как?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Нормально.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "Слушай, а в твоём лексиконе есть другие слова, кроме этого «нормально»?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Папа сказал, что взрослым нельзя говорить «отвали»...", "uncensored": "Папа сказал, что взрослым нельзя говорить «отъебись»...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-8e7f515e4ba5.en", "jokeId": "ru-8e7f515e4ba5", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; Vovochka is Johnny. The neighbour is an elderly woman (tyoshcha in a headscarf). Only the swear word is softened.", "title": "Fine", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["tyoshcha", "vovochka"], "roles": {"tyoshcha": "old-woman", "vovochka": "vovochka"}, "looks": {"tyoshcha": {"add": ["headscarf"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "How are you, Johnny?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["vovochka"]}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Fine.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "And how's school?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Fine.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "And how's your health?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Fine.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "Listen, do you have any other words in your vocabulary besides this \"fine\"?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Dad said you're not allowed to tell grown-ups to \"get lost\"...", "uncensored": "Dad said you're not allowed to tell grown-ups to \"fuck off\"...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-8e7f515e4ba5.de", "jokeId": "ru-8e7f515e4ba5", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line ('normal' → 'gut', the natural German answer); Vovochka is Fritzchen. The neighbour is an elderly woman (tyoshcha in a headscarf). Only the swear word is softened.", "title": "Gut", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["tyoshcha", "vovochka"], "roles": {"tyoshcha": "old-woman", "vovochka": "fritzchen"}, "looks": {"tyoshcha": {"add": ["headscarf"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "Wie geht's, Fritzchen?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["vovochka"]}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Gut.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "Und wie ist es in der Schule?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Gut.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "Und wie geht's der Gesundheit?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Gut.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "tyoshcha", "text": "Sag mal, hast du in deinem Wortschatz noch andere Wörter außer diesem \"gut\"?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "vovochka", "text": "Papa hat gesagt, zu Erwachsenen darf man nicht \"hau ab\" sagen...", "uncensored": "Papa hat gesagt, zu Erwachsenen darf man nicht \"verpiss dich\" sagen...", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-9a110b9b52ff.ru", "jokeId": "ru-9a110b9b52ff", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Kept as written; the teacher's request turned into direct speech, 'Учительница в ужасе' shown by her face and a gasping class. The source's censored 'х-як' / 'на х-й' are voiced as 'бац' / 'на фиг', uncensored spelled out.", "title": "Самый запомнившийся бой", "location": "klass", "cast": ["uchilka", "ded"], "roles": {"uchilka": "teacher", "ded": "old-man"}, "scenes": [{"location": "klass", "cast": ["uchilka", "ded"], "roles": {"uchilka": "teacher", "ded": "old-man"}, "looks": {"ded": {"add": ["badge"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "pupils", "size": "many"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "uchilka", "to": "teacher-desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "ded", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "gasp"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Пригласили один раз ветерана войны на урок истории в третий класс.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Расскажите самый запомнившийся вам бой.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Ну, значит, попали мы в окружение под Минском.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Бац слева немцы, бац справа немцы и спереди немцы.", "uncensored": "Хуяк слева немцы, хуяк справа немцы и спереди немцы.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Это же дети!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Какие на фиг дети?! Фашисты!", "uncensored": "Какие на хуй дети?! Фашисты!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-9a110b9b52ff.en", "jokeId": "ru-9a110b9b52ff", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the censored onomatopoeia becomes 'holy crap' (uncensored 'holy shit') per adaptNote, 'на х-й' → 'freaking' / 'fucking'. The class gasps instead of narrating the teacher's horror.", "title": "The Battle He Remembers", "location": "klass", "cast": ["uchilka", "ded"], "roles": {"uchilka": "teacher", "ded": "old-man"}, "scenes": [{"location": "klass", "cast": ["uchilka", "ded"], "roles": {"uchilka": "teacher", "ded": "old-man"}, "looks": {"ded": {"add": ["badge"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "pupils", "size": "many"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "uchilka", "to": "teacher-desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "ded", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "gasp"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Once a war veteran was invited to a third-grade history lesson.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Tell us about the battle you remember most.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Well, so, we got surrounded near Minsk.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Holy crap, Germans on the left, holy crap, Germans on the right, and Germans up front.", "uncensored": "Holy shit, Germans on the left, holy shit, Germans on the right, and Germans up front.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "These are children!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "ded", "text": "What freaking children?! Fascists!", "uncensored": "What fucking children?! Fascists!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-9a110b9b52ff.de", "jokeId": "ru-9a110b9b52ff", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the censored onomatopoeia becomes 'Mist' (uncensored 'Scheiße') per adaptNote, 'на х-й' → 'verdammte' / 'Scheiß-'. The class gasps instead of narrating the teacher's horror.", "title": "Die Schlacht", "location": "klass", "cast": ["uchilka", "ded"], "roles": {"uchilka": "teacher", "ded": "old-man"}, "scenes": [{"location": "klass", "cast": ["uchilka", "ded"], "roles": {"uchilka": "teacher", "ded": "old-man"}, "looks": {"ded": {"add": ["badge"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "pupils", "size": "many"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "uchilka", "to": "teacher-desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "ded", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "gasp"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Einmal wurde ein Kriegsveteran in den Geschichtsunterricht einer dritten Klasse eingeladen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Erzählen Sie uns von der Schlacht, an die Sie sich am meisten erinnern.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Also, wir sind bei Minsk eingekesselt worden.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Mist, links Deutsche, Mist, rechts Deutsche, und vorne auch Deutsche.", "uncensored": "Scheiße, links Deutsche, Scheiße, rechts Deutsche, und vorne auch Deutsche.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "uchilka", "text": "Das sind doch Kinder!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "ded", "text": "Was für verdammte Kinder?! Faschisten!", "uncensored": "Was für Scheißkinder?! Faschisten!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-d25b050b8d0f.ru", "jokeId": "ru-d25b050b8d0f", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Both lines kept as written; 'Звоню. Спрашиваю' and 'отвечает жена' are shown by a cross-cut phone call: the man on the street, his wife in the kitchen.", "title": "Любимая", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband"}, "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}]}, {"location": "kukhnya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["zhena"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife"}, "beats": [{"type": "prop", "who": "zhena", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Это ты, любимая?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Нет, это я.", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
